{"type":"message","id":"619885cf","parentId":"a2861b47","timestamp":"2026-02-18T10:29:08.058Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I've captured the exact error when trying to start the OpenClaw gateway. Here's what I found:\n\n## Gateway Startup Error\n\nThe gateway failed to start because:\n1. **Gateway already running** - Process ID 16492 is already running\n2. **Port conflict** - Port 18789 is already in use by node.exe\n3. **Lock timeout** - The startup timed out after 5000ms waiting for the lock\n\n## Error Details\n- **Error message**: \"Gateway failed to start: gateway already running (pid 16492); lock timeout after 5000ms\"\n- **Port**: 18789 (already in use)\n- **Running process**: node.exe with PID 16492\n- **Suggestions provided**: \n  - `openclaw gateway stop`\n  - `schtasks /End /TN \"OpenClaw Gateway\"`\n\n## Solution\nTo fix this, you need to stop the existing gateway process first using:\n```bash\nopenclaw gateway stop\n```\nor\n```bash\nschtasks /End /TN \"OpenClaw Gateway\"\n```\n\nThe error has been written to `gateway-startup-error.log` in your workspace root."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"arcee-ai/trinity-large-preview:free","usage":{"input":12637,"output":245,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12882,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771410542771}}
